{"id": "t075-056", "text": "ravi texted, his dad's been readmitted, infection after the knee op. in from tues probably till friday, then physio twice a wk until christmas. ravi's covering his dad's shifts at the shop on top of his own job and his mum doesnt drive so he's doing all the hospital runs too. remind me to call ravi sat, and the week after offer to do a shop run for them", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "ravi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "readmitted", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "infection", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee op", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "from tues probably till friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "physio", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "twice a wk until christmas", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "ravi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "shifts at the shop", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesnt drive", "owner": "r3", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call ravi", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "ravi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sat", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to do a shop run for them", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "